  "scope": "Native Kubernetes v1.36.1 admission checks exact HTTPS and OCI values in declared environment fields on Pods, Deployments, ReplicaSets, ReplicationControllers, StatefulSets, DaemonSets, Jobs and CronJobs in a protected namespace, including normal and init containers. Requests use server dry-run and a real zero-replica Deployment. A separate VAP checks the image of a container explicitly named model-carrier on Pods and Deployments against its own key in the same ConfigMap; unrelated container images are not interpreted as model carriers. No image is pulled. The test covers an admissible update, allowlist rotation and a missing parameter. Other model-source fields, additional image-carrier object kinds, actual image pulls and production governance remain open.",
